 CellLabel->"Out[3]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4aa0d4e4-fd2c-4838-87e5-d60da93718d1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Tarski's segment construction on a path: from 2 through 3, lay off a segment \
as long as 5\[Dash]7.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"634549b2-a1e2-498a-bf0e-f869b05f4951"],

